{"id":80,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿabasa watawallā","translation":"He frowned and turned ˹his attention˺ away"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","transliteration":"An jāahu l-aʿmā","translation":"˹simply˺ because the blind man came to him ˹interrupting˺"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"Wamā yud'rīka laʿallahu yazzakkā","translation":"You never know ˹O Prophet˺, perhaps he may be purified"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"أَوْ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Aw yadhakkaru fatanfaʿahu dh-dhik'rā","translation":"or he may be mindful, benefitting from the reminder"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ","transliteration":"Ammā mani is'taghnā","translation":"As for the one who was indifferent"},{"number":6,"arabicText":"فَأَنتَ لَهُۥ تَصَدَّىٰ","transliteration":"Fa-anta lahu taṣaddā","translation":"you gave him your ˹undivided˺ attention"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"وَمَا عَلَيْكَ أَلَّا يَزَّكَّىٰ","transliteration":"Wamā ʿalayka allā yazzakkā","translation":"even though you are not to blame if he would not be purified"},{"number":8,"arabicText":"وَأَمَّا مَن جَآءَكَ يَسْعَىٰ","transliteration":"Wa-ammā man jāaka yasʿā","translation":"But as for the one who came to you, eager ˹to learn˺"},{"number":9,"arabicText":"وَهُوَ يَخْشَىٰ","transliteration":"Wahuwa yakhshā","translation":"being in awe ˹of Allah˺"},{"number":10,"arabicText":"فَأَنتَ عَنْهُ تَلَهَّىٰ","transliteration":"Fa-anta ʿanhu talahhā","translation":"you were inattentive to him"},{"number":11,"arabicText":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهَا تَذْكِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Kallā innahā tadhkiratun","translation":"But no! This ˹revelation˺ is truly a reminder"},{"number":12,"arabicText":"فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Faman shāa dhakarah","translation":"So let whoever wills be mindful of it"},{"number":13,"arabicText":"فِى صُحُفٍۢ مُّكَرَّمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Fī ṣuḥufim-mukarramatin","translation":"It is ˹written˺ on pages held in honour—"},{"number":14,"arabicText":"مَّرْفُوعَةٍۢ مُّطَهَّرَةٍۭ","transliteration":"Marfūʿatim-muṭahharatin","translation":"highly esteemed, purified—"},{"number":15,"arabicText":"بِأَيْدِى سَفَرَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Bi-aydī safaratin","translation":"by the hands of angel-scribes"},{"number":16,"arabicText":"كِرَامٍۭ بَرَرَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Kirāmin bararatin","translation":"honourable and virtuous"},{"number":17,"arabicText":"قُتِلَ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مَآ أَكْفَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Qutila l-insānu mā akfarah","translation":"Condemned are ˹disbelieving˺ humans! How ungrateful they are ˹to Allah˺"},{"number":18,"arabicText":"مِنْ أَىِّ شَىْءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ","transliteration":"Min ayyi shayin khalaqah","translation":"From what substance did He create them"},{"number":19,"arabicText":"مِن نُّطْفَةٍ خَلَقَهُۥ فَقَدَّرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Min-nuṭ'fatin khalaqahu faqaddarah","translation":"He created them from a sperm-drop, and ordained their development"},{"number":20,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma s-sabīla yassarah","translation":"Then He makes the way easy for them"},{"number":21,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ أَمَاتَهُۥ فَأَقْبَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma amātahu fa-aqbarah","translation":"then causes them to die and be buried"},{"number":22,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma idhā shāa ansharah","translation":"Then when He wills, He will resurrect them"},{"number":23,"arabicText":"كَلَّا لَمَّا يَقْضِ مَآ أَمَرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Kallā lammā yaqḍi mā amarah","translation":"But no! They have failed to comply with what He ordered"},{"number":24,"arabicText":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"Falyanẓuri l-insānu ilā ṭaʿāmih","translation":"Let people then consider their food"},{"number":25,"arabicText":"أَنَّا صَبَبْنَا ٱلْمَآءَ صَبًّۭا","transliteration":"Annā ṣababnā l-māa ṣabban","translation":"how We pour down rain in abundance"},{"number":26,"arabicText":"ثُمَّ شَقَقْنَا ٱلْأَرْضَ شَقًّۭا","transliteration":"Thumma shaqaqnā l-arḍa shaqqan","translation":"and meticulously split the earth open ˹for sprouts˺"},{"number":27,"arabicText":"فَأَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا حَبًّۭا","transliteration":"Fa-anbatnā fīhā ḥabban","translation":"causing grain to grow in it"},{"number":28,"arabicText":"وَعِنَبًۭا وَقَضْبًۭا","transliteration":"Waʿinabaw-waqaḍban","translation":"as well as grapes and greens"},{"number":29,"arabicText":"وَزَيْتُونًۭا وَنَخْلًۭا","transliteration":"Wazaytūnaw-wanakhlan","translation":"and olives and palm trees"},{"number":30,"arabicText":"وَحَدَآئِقَ غُلْبًۭا","transliteration":"Waḥadāiqa ghul'ban","translation":"and dense orchards"},{"number":31,"arabicText":"وَفَٰكِهَةًۭ وَأَبًّۭا","transliteration":"Wafākihataw-wa-abban","translation":"and fruit and fodder—"},{"number":32,"arabicText":"مَّتَٰعًۭا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَٰمِكُمْ","transliteration":"Matāʿal-lakum wali-anʿāmikum","translation":"all as ˹a means of˺ sustenance for you and your animals"},{"number":33,"arabicText":"فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلصَّآخَّةُ","transliteration":"Fa-idhā jāati ṣ-ṣākhat","translation":"Then, when the Deafening Blast comes to pass—"},{"number":34,"arabicText":"يَوْمَ يَفِرُّ ٱلْمَرْءُ مِنْ أَخِيهِ","transliteration":"Yawma yafirru l-maru min akhīh","translation":"on that Day every person will flee from their own siblings"},{"number":35,"arabicText":"وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ","transliteration":"Wa-ummihi wa-abīh","translation":"and ˹even˺ their mother and father"},{"number":36,"arabicText":"وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَبَنِيهِ","transliteration":"Waṣāḥibatihi wabanīh","translation":"and ˹even˺ their spouse and children"},{"number":37,"arabicText":"لِكُلِّ ٱمْرِئٍۢ مِّنْهُمْ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ شَأْنٌۭ يُغْنِيهِ","transliteration":"Likulli im'ri-im-min'hum yawma-idhin shanuy-yugh'nīh","translation":"For then everyone will have enough concern of their own"},{"number":38,"arabicText":"وُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ مُّسْفِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Wujūhuy-yawma-idhin mus'firatun","translation":"On that Day ˹some˺ faces will be bright"},{"number":39,"arabicText":"ضَاحِكَةٌۭ مُّسْتَبْشِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Ḍāḥikatum-mus'tabshiratun","translation":"laughing and rejoicing"},{"number":40,"arabicText":"وَوُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَلَيْهَا غَبَرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Wawujūhuy-yawma-idhin ʿalayhā ghabaratun","translation":"while ˹other˺ faces will be dusty"},{"number":41,"arabicText":"تَرْهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ","transliteration":"Tarhaquhā qataratun","translation":"cast in gloom—"},{"number":42,"arabicText":"أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَفَرَةُ ٱلْفَجَرَةُ","transliteration":"Ulāika humu l-kafaratu l-fajarat","translation":"those are the disbelievers, the ˹wicked˺ sinners"}]}